Based on the provided file contents, `diamond.h` already declares `rows`, and `diamond.cpp` implements `rows`. However, to be absolutely sure and to follow the instruction to "Fix any errors", I will output the corrected files. The logic in `diamond.cpp` correctly generates the diamond shape as per the requirements.

