To implement the `sum` function as described, I will replace the skeleton code 
with the logic to calculate the sum of unique multiples.



The function takes an array of base values and a level number. It needs to:

1. Find all multiples of each base value that are less than the level.

2. Combine them into a set to remove duplicates.

3. Sum the values in the set.



I will update `sum-of-multiples.js` with this implementation.



