connected empty cells starting from `(x, y)`. It also determines the owner of 
this territory by checking the surrounding stones. If the territory touches both
Black and White stones, the owner is `NONE`. If it touches only one color, that 
color is the owner. If it touches no stones (e.g., an empty board), the owner is
`NONE`.

