4.  Extract description formatting into a helper function.

5.  Extract amount formatting into a helper function, handling locale-specific 
currency symbols, separators, and negative number representations.

6.  Remove the concurrent processing (goroutines/channel) which adds complexity 
without benefit for this small task and makes error handling messy.

